<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>Hail season in McAllen and Hidalgo County peaks in April and May. A roof can be damaged even when it looks fine from the ground.</li>
<li>Each roof type shows hail damage differently. Shingles bruise and shed granules, metal dents and loses coating, tile cracks, and flat roofs puncture or blister.</li>
<li>Dated photos, a NOAA storm record, and a written inspection give your roof hail damage insurance claim the evidence it needs.</li>
