<li><strong>April 21, 2023:</strong> up to an hour of continuous hail across southern Hidalgo County, with baseball-size reports near Peñitas and McCook (<a href="https://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/stormevents/eventdetails.jsp?id=1084560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCEI event record</a>).</li>
<li><strong>May 8, 2025:</strong> a supercell produced hail up to 3 inches in north McAllen (<a href="https://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/stormevents/eventdetails.jsp?id=1263450" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCEI event record</a>).</li>
</ul>

